nutrition the baby can have.

00:08:08.151 --> 00:08:08.411
Right.

00:08:08.531 --> 00:08:12.093
You're, you're making it a more convenient shape without shrinking your babies.

00:08:12.193 --> 00:08:13.373
You're making it ergonomic.

00:08:13.733 --> 00:08:13.973
